msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Tutorials/Demos/GPU-Buffer-Transport.rst:228
msgid ""
"The renderer's publisher code shows how ``torch_conversions::"
"allocate_tensor_msg`` and ``torch_conversions::to_tensor_msg`` produce an "
"``ExperimentalTensor`` whose ``data`` field is CUDA-backed."
